==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|ru|недѣ́ля}} {{ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ru|orv|недѣлꙗ|t=Sunday}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*neděľa|t=Sunday}}. Equivalent to {{affix|ru|не-|де́лать|-я|t1=not|alt2=де́л-|t2=work}}. Originally used to mean [[Sunday]], the day of rest.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|неде́ля}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-неделя.ogg|Audio}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|неде́ля}}

# [[week]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[в]] '''неде́лю'''|per week}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[на]] [[прошлый|про́шлой]] '''неде́ле'''|last week}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[на]] [[этот|э́той]] '''неде́ле'''|this week}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[на]] [[будущий|бу́дущей]] '''неде́ле'''|next week}}
# {{lb|ru|archaic}} [[Sunday]]

